{"title":"Career Roadmap · Online Tutor","role":"Online Tutor","summary":"An Online Tutor provides subject-specific teaching, academic support and skill development through digital platforms.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Ed (Bachelor of Education)","Course":"B.Ed - Subject Pedagogy (Science / Maths / Social Studies / Languages / Commerce)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Online Tutor provides subject-specific teaching, academic support and skill development through digital platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a conventional classroom teacher, an online tutor must combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Subject Expertise","Pedagogy","Digital Teaching","Communication","Content Creation","Student Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Online tutors may teach:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"School subjects"},{"text":"Competitive-exam subjects"},{"text":"Languages"},{"text":"Commerce"},{"text":"Mathematics"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"Social studies"},{"text":"Professional skills"},{"text":"Coding or technology subjects, where qualified"}]},{"type":"p","text":"They may work through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Online tutoring platforms"},{"text":"Schools offering virtual programs"},{"text":"Coaching organizations"},{"text":"YouTube/educational content platforms"},{"text":"Independent tutoring businesses"},{"text":"Freelance teaching"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Qualification note","text":"Online tutoring itself is generally an occupation rather than a single regulated profession. However, a B.Ed is especially valuable for school-level teaching because it develops pedagogy, assessment and classroom-management skills. Specific school-teaching posts and formal teacher eligibility requirements can involve additional qualifications or eligibility tests depending on the institution and applicable rules."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":