ual models"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Languages"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vocabulary exercises"},{"text":"Grammar practice"},{"text":"Writing prompts"},{"text":"Conversation simulations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social Studies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Timelines"},{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"Quiz questions"},{"text":"Map-based activities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting problems"},{"text":"Business case studies"},{"text":"Financial examples"},{"text":"Data-analysis exercises"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Complete Online Course"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a mini-course around one subject topic."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning objectives"},{"text":"5–10 lessons"},{"text":"Slides"},{"text":"Videos"},{"text":"Worksheets"},{"text":"Quizzes"},{"text":"Final assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Digital Lesson Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create 10 sample lessons showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lesson objective"},{"text":"Teaching strategy"},{"text":"Digital activity"},{"text":"Assessment"},{"text":"Homework"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Student Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI dashboard using synthetic student data."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Test scores"},{"text":"Topic accuracy"},{"text":"Assignment completion"},{"text":"Improvement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Educational YouTube Channel"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small academic content portfolio."},{"type":"p","text":"Content could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5-minute concept videos"},{"text":"Exam tips"},{"text":"Problem-solving videos"},{"text":"Revision lessons"},{"text":"The goal is to demonstrate teaching ability, not simply follower count."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — AI-Powered Practice Syste